# The games database loader's run-once token (scripts/games-db-load.mjs).
#
# Second load, 2026-11-05, for the owner's «every game should be full in
# information»: every title again with the rest of Nintendo's facts (play
# modes, local and online players, Nintendo Switch Online, cloud saves, the
# 16:9 picture, the downloads rank) into nintendo_title_details, and the
# shop's games linked by name even when the name ends in its console. It
# writes only nintendo_titles, nintendo_title_genres, nintendo_title_details
# and the revision stamp — never the catalogue, and no prices.
#
# It is claimed in console_runs before the first write, so it can never write
# twice. To run again, replace the line below with a NEW token (letters,
# digits, dots, dashes or underscores, 6 to 80 characters) and push; a later
# run writes only the titles that changed. Remove the line to go back to dry.
2026-11-05-games-db-details-1
